# The built bundle is committed, because consumers install this package from git
# and resolve package.json's `main` out of the checkout -- see the note on
# 1_perun-atlas-generate-js in .gitlab-ci.yml. It is still a build artifact, and
# every frontend change rewrites all of it as one minified line: a two-file diff
# came to 300 KB, which is a review nobody reads and a merge nobody can resolve.
#
# `-diff` makes git treat it as binary, so a diff says the file changed and
# stops. `linguist-generated` keeps it out of language stats and collapses it in
# GitLab's own diff view. Neither changes what is committed or served.
backend/www/perun-atlas.js       -diff linguist-generated
backend/www/perun-atlas.js.map   -diff linguist-generated
backend/www/perun-atlas.js.LICENSE.txt -diff linguist-generated
